# Historical weather backfill (admin only). Stores past hours from the Open-Meteo archive for every installation with coordinates.
# Port matches launchSettings.json (http profile). Paste a bearer token of an Admin from POST /api/auth/login.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080
@token = paste-access-token

### Backfill 30 days (from..to inclusive, UTC, at most 31 days, to must be before today)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/weather/backfill
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "from": "2026-10-01",
  "to": "2026-10-30"
}

### Invalid: to is not before the first day (expect 400 ProblemDetails)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/weather/backfill
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "from": "2026-10-10",
  "to": "2026-10-01"
}
